@startuml Agent Life v2 - Real-Time Event Flow
!theme vibrant
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam shadowing true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title Agent Life v2 - Real-Time Socket.IO Event Flow

actor "User" as User #4169E1
participant "Frontend\n(Vue.js)" as Frontend #32CD32
participant "Socket.IO\nClient" as SocketClient #FF6347
participant "Socket.IO\nServer" as SocketServer #FF8C00
participant "Redis\nPub/Sub" as Redis #9370DB
participant "Status\nAggregator" as StatusAgg #FF69B4
participant "Action\nOrchestrator" as Orchestrator #FFD700
participant "Agent\nService" as Agent #00CED1

== Connection & Subscription ==

User -> Frontend : Opens Monitor tab
activate Frontend

Frontend -> SocketClient : Initialize connection
activate SocketClient

SocketClient -> SocketServer : Connect with JWT token
activate SocketServer

SocketServer --> SocketClient : Connection established
note right: Socket ID assigned

Frontend -> SocketClient : emit('subscribe_cycle_updates',\n{execution_id, user_id})
SocketClient -> SocketServer : Forward subscription
SocketServer -> SocketServer : Join room\n'cycle_<execution_id>'
SocketServer --> SocketClient : Subscription confirmed
SocketClient --> Frontend : Ready to receive events

== Cycle Execution with Real-Time Updates ==

Orchestrator -> Agent : Execute action\n"READ_POSTS"
activate Agent
activate Orchestrator

Orchestrator -> StatusAgg : Action started event
activate StatusAgg

StatusAgg -> StatusAgg : Create log entry\nin database

StatusAgg -> SocketServer : emit('agent_action_started',\n{agent_id, action_name})
SocketServer -> Redis : Publish to\ncycle_<execution_id>
activate Redis
Redis --> SocketServer : Confirmed
deactivate Redis

SocketServer --> SocketClient : Broadcast to room\n'cycle_<execution_id>'
note right #FFE4B5
  Event data:
  {
    execution_id: "abc-123",
    agent_id: "FRBG/agent1",
    action_name: "READ_POSTS",
    timestamp: "2025-11-19T10:00:00Z"
  }
end note

SocketClient --> Frontend : Emit 'agent_action_started'
Frontend -> Frontend : Update Pinia store
Frontend -> Frontend : Update UI:\n- Agent status badge\n- Progress bar\n- Log viewer
Frontend --> User : Display update
deactivate StatusAgg

Agent --> Orchestrator : Action completed
deactivate Agent

Orchestrator -> StatusAgg : Action completed event
activate StatusAgg

StatusAgg -> StatusAgg : Create log entry\nCalculate duration

StatusAgg -> SocketServer : emit('agent_action_completed',\n{agent_id, action_name, duration})
SocketServer -> Redis : Publish event
activate Redis
Redis --> SocketServer : Confirmed
deactivate Redis

SocketServer --> SocketClient : Broadcast completion
SocketClient --> Frontend : Emit 'agent_action_completed'
Frontend -> Frontend : Update UI:\n- Mark action complete\n- Update statistics\n- Add to logs
Frontend --> User : Show completion
deactivate StatusAgg

== Progress Update ==

Orchestrator -> StatusAgg : Progress update\n(every 15 seconds)
activate StatusAgg

StatusAgg -> StatusAgg : Calculate metrics:\n- Percentage\n- Success rate\n- ETA

StatusAgg -> SocketServer : emit('cycle_progress_update',\n{execution_id, progress})
SocketServer -> Redis : Publish progress
activate Redis
Redis --> SocketServer : Confirmed
deactivate Redis

SocketServer --> SocketClient : Broadcast progress
note right #E0FFE0
  Progress data:
  {
    current_day: 2,
    total_days: 3,
    percentage: 66.7,
    completed_actions: 20,
    total_actions: 30,
    success_rate: 95.0
  }
end note

SocketClient --> Frontend : Emit progress update
Frontend -> Frontend : Animate progress bar
Frontend -> Frontend : Update counters
Frontend --> User : Visual feedback
deactivate StatusAgg

== Action Failure Scenario ==

Orchestrator -> Agent : Execute action\n"DO_ACTION"
activate Agent
activate Orchestrator

Agent --> Orchestrator : Action failed\nwith error
deactivate Agent

Orchestrator -> StatusAgg : Action failed event
activate StatusAgg

StatusAgg -> StatusAgg : Log error\nIncrement fail count

StatusAgg -> SocketServer : emit('agent_action_failed',\n{agent_id, action_name, error})
SocketServer -> Redis : Publish error
activate Redis
Redis --> SocketServer : Confirmed
deactivate Redis

SocketServer --> SocketClient : Broadcast failure
note right #FFE0E0
  Error data:
  {
    agent_id: "FRBG/agent1",
    action_name: "DO_ACTION",
    error: "Connection timeout",
    timestamp: "2025-11-19T10:15:00Z"
  }
end note

SocketClient --> Frontend : Emit error event
Frontend -> Frontend : Show error alert
Frontend -> Frontend : Update agent status\nto "failed"
Frontend -> Frontend : Add error to logs\nwith red highlight
Frontend --> User : Display error notification
deactivate StatusAgg
deactivate Orchestrator

== User Control Action ==

User -> Frontend : Clicks "Pause"
Frontend -> Frontend : API call:\nPOST .../pause/
note left: Non-Socket.IO\nREST API call

Frontend -> SocketClient : Wait for status update

StatusAgg -> SocketServer : emit('cycle_status_update',\n{execution_id, status: 'paused'})
activate StatusAgg
SocketServer -> Redis : Publish status change
activate Redis
Redis --> SocketServer : Confirmed
deactivate Redis

SocketServer --> SocketClient : Broadcast status
SocketClient --> Frontend : Emit status update
Frontend -> Frontend : Update UI:\n- Disable pause button\n- Enable resume button\n- Show paused badge
Frontend --> User : Visual confirmation
deactivate StatusAgg

== Completion & Cleanup ==

Orchestrator -> StatusAgg : Cycle completed
activate StatusAgg
activate Orchestrator

StatusAgg -> SocketServer : emit('cycle_status_update',\n{status: 'completed'})
SocketServer -> Redis : Publish completion
activate Redis
Redis --> SocketServer : Confirmed
deactivate Redis

SocketServer --> SocketClient : Broadcast completion
SocketClient --> Frontend : Emit completion
Frontend -> Frontend : Show success notification
Frontend -> Frontend : Update analytics
Frontend --> User : Display results
deactivate StatusAgg
deactivate Orchestrator

User -> Frontend : Navigates away
Frontend -> SocketClient : emit('unsubscribe_cycle_updates',\n{execution_id})
SocketClient -> SocketServer : Forward unsubscribe
SocketServer -> SocketServer : Leave room
SocketServer --> SocketClient : Unsubscribed
deactivate SocketServer
deactivate SocketClient
deactivate Frontend

legend right
  |= Event Type |= Color |
  | Connection | <back:#E0E0E0>   </back> |
  | Action Started | <back:#FFE4B5>   </back> |
  | Action Completed | <back:#E0FFE0>   </back> |
  | Action Failed | <back:#FFE0E0>   </back> |
  | Progress Update | <back:#E0F0FF>   </back> |
endlegend

note over User, Agent
  **Key Features:**
  • Real-time updates without polling
  • Room-based event targeting
  • Redis pub/sub for scaling
  • Throttled progress updates (15s)
  • Automatic reconnection
  • Event persistence in database
end note

@enduml
